{
    "title": "Word Town: Find Words & Crush!",
    "description": "Searching for brain games? Look no further! This free crossword game with charming landscapes is your final destination! You may search and find hidden words, enjoy the fun of crushing letters, and travel around the world at the same time. It's a fantastic way to relax both your body and mind!\r\n\r\nIn Word Town, there are numerous challenging puzzles to sharpen your mind! Solving puzzles along the journey to different cities around the world will double your fun! Moreover, competing with friends and family members in this game would strengthen your associations!\r\n\r\nWord Town is developed by the maker of Word Serenity, Word Carnival, Word Search Pop, Word Tile Puzzle and Word Blast. If you're a fan of classic crossword puzzles, innovative crossword puzzles, anagrams, grammar quizzes, spelling quizzes and so on, this game is the perfect fit. You're guaranteed to become a word game pro after you play this game for a few days.\r\n\r\nAs you progress in this game, you may also unlock a lot of surprises. The further you progress, the more you will explore. The Undersea Party is a collecting activity that will give you big rewards. The Daily Puzzle gives you a chance to collect exquisite trophies. Discover more by yourself to enjoy the fun of being an explorer.\r\n\r\nKEY PLAY MODES:\r\n- Word Fall: connect letters to find and crush words.\r\n- Word Rise: swipe bubbles to make words.\r\n- Hidden Words: guess words and find them.\r\n- Word Blast: swipe tiles to blast words.\r\n- Grammar Quiz: choose the best answer.\r\n- Spelling Quiz: choose the correct spelling.\r\n\r\nMAIN FEATURES:\r\n- Simple to play! Find words and enjoy the fun of crushing letters.\r\n- A collection of different play modes! Choose the game you like to play.\r\n- Numerous crossword puzzles! Train your brain and sharpen your mind.\r\n- Travel around the world without going out! Take a journey while solving puzzles. \r\n- Real-time Leaderboard! Try to defeat your friends and family members.\r\n- Fun collecting activities! Daily Puzzle, Treasure Hunt, Undersea Party and more!\r\n- Free offline word game! No internet connection required.\r\n\r\nWant a way to kill boring time with your friends in a party? Need something to entertain yourself while enjoying cookies or snacks? Wanna improve your vocabulary in a pleasant way? Download Word Town now to enjoy the rich puzzles and aspire to become a word game pro!\r\n\r\nIf you have any suggestions or feedback regarding Word Town, please do not hesitate to contact us. You can either send us a message in Word Town, or email us at: wordtown_129_2@histudiosupport.com.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: http://www.histudiogames.com/terms/\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.histudiogames.com/privacy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Searching for brain games? Look no further! This free crossword game with charming landscapes is your final destination! You may search and find hidden words, enjoy the fun of crushing letters, and travel around the world at the same time. It&#39;s a fantastic way to relax both your body and mind!<br><br>In Word Town, there are numerous challenging puzzles to sharpen your mind! Solving puzzles along the journey to different cities around the world will double your fun! Moreover, competing with friends and family members in this game would strengthen your associations!<br><br>Word Town is developed by the maker of Word Serenity, Word Carnival, Word Search Pop, Word Tile Puzzle and Word Blast. If you&#39;re a fan of classic crossword puzzles, innovative crossword puzzles, anagrams, grammar quizzes, spelling quizzes and so on, this game is the perfect fit. You&#39;re guaranteed to become a word game pro after you play this game for a few days.<br><br>As you progress in this game, you may also unlock a lot of surprises. The further you progress, the more you will explore. The Undersea Party is a collecting activity that will give you big rewards. The Daily Puzzle gives you a chance to collect exquisite trophies. Discover more by yourself to enjoy the fun of being an explorer.<br><br>KEY PLAY MODES:<br>- Word Fall: connect letters to find and crush words.<br>- Word Rise: swipe bubbles to make words.<br>- Hidden Words: guess words and find them.<br>- Word Blast: swipe tiles to blast words.<br>- Grammar Quiz: choose the best answer.<br>- Spelling Quiz: choose the correct spelling.<br><br>MAIN FEATURES:<br>- Simple to play! Find words and enjoy the fun of crushing letters.<br>- A collection of different play modes! Choose the game you like to play.<br>- Numerous crossword puzzles! Train your brain and sharpen your mind.<br>- Travel around the world without going out! Take a journey while solving puzzles. <br>- Real-time Leaderboard! Try to defeat your friends and family members.<br>- Fun collecting activities! Daily Puzzle, Treasure Hunt, Undersea Party and more!<br>- Free offline word game! No internet connection required.<br><br>Want a way to kill boring time with your friends in a party? Need something to entertain yourself while enjoying cookies or snacks? Wanna improve your vocabulary in a pleasant way? Download Word Town now to enjoy the rich puzzles and aspire to become a word game pro!<br><br>If you have any suggestions or feedback regarding Word Town, please do not hesitate to contact us. You can either send us a message in Word Town, or email us at: wordtown_129_2@histudiosupport.com.<br><br>Terms of Service: http://www.histudiogames.com/terms/<br>Privacy Policy: http://www.histudiogames.com/privacy/",
